  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 512.06 Breakwater Construction Project Classification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 512.06 Breakwater Construction Project Classification.\n\n(a) Breakwater construction shall be a major project, regardless of the size of the breakwater.\n\n(b) Classification as a major project pursuant to (a), above, shall:\n\n(1) Take precedence over any lower classification; and\n\n(2) Not be subject to a waiver.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
